docs {
  GET /pre-consultation/session/result/
  
  Step 11 health-map summary: explored health systems, concern/cluster counts, lifestyle context, ranked goals.
  Available when current_layer = patient_health_map (after goals PUT). Works in-progress or completed.
  Run before Complete Session.
  Reference: docs/pre_consultation/api-pre-consultation.md
}
